            "A milestone is not self-verifying. A contract may define the event that opens a tranche, but someone still has to observe evidence, determine whether it meets the definition, record the result, and provide a route for challenge. If those tasks are poorly designed, the payment formula may be precise while the certification remains discretionary or contested.",
