            "Conservation is a powerful invariant because it makes hidden value difficult to excuse as a rounding accident or an undocumented side account. If the pledge is partitioned into the model's defined categories and the total reconciles, the analyst can account for the whole amount within the model. The proof does not establish that the original pledge was funded, that the custodian holds it in the stated currency, or that a transfer can be executed under applicable law.",
